fore मरण dying, and अन्त end, ठक् aff.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आमरणांतिक"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AmaraRAMtika"]}], "amarasa": [{"id": "Amarasa", "headword": "आमरस", "headword_slp1": "Amarasa", "fold": "amarasa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "आमरस m. (-सः) Imperfect chyme.\n E. आम and रस juice.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आमरसः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AmarasaH"]}], "amalaka": [{"id": "Amalaka", "headword": "आमलक", "headword_slp1": "Amalaka", "fold": "amalaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "आमलक mfn. (-कः-की-कं) Emblic myrobalan, (Phyllanthus emblica.)\n m.\n(-कः) Another plant, (Justicia adhenatoda, &c.)\n n. (-कं) The fruit\nof the myrobalan.\n E. आङ् and मल् to hold, वुन् aff. fem. ङीष् having\nall medicinal virtues.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आमलकं", "आमलकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AmalakaM", "AmalakaH"]}, {"id": "AmAlaka", "headword": "आमालक", "headword_slp1": "AmAlaka", "fold": "amalaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "आमालक mn. (-कः-कं) Land near a mountain.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आमालकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AmAlakaH"]}], "amavata": [{"id": "AmavAta", "headword": "आमवात", "headword_slp1": "AmavAta", "fold": "amavata", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "आमवात m. (-तः) Constipation or torpor of the bowels, with flatulence\nand intumescence.\n E. आम and वात wind, the wind being supposed\nto be chiefly affected.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आमवातः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AmavAtaH"]}], "amasula": [{"id": "AmaSUla", "headword": "आमशूल", "headword_slp1": "AmaSUla", "fold": "amasula", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "आमशूल m. (-लः) The cholic, pain arising from indigestion.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आमशूलः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AmaSUlaH"]}], "amatisara": [{"id": "AmA